The number of ring machine steps for 4 steps of a network of 3 automata:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->285261028,ExpressionUUID->"05b0b30b-de94-4d32-9214-11ed2ff9cb04"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"net", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_"}], "}"}], " ", ":>", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "y"}], ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}], "}"}],
